The theme of an opposition is blame or learning from an- 
other's actions. This projection can run the gamut from love to 
hate and will be placed upon some object, person, or group 
which is outside of us. The key to working with the opposition 
is to realize that the projection is coming from within and the 
external events are merely a mirror. 


