find that you can now take effective action and move into a 
mode of "I, myself, doing my own thing and striving for my own 
independence." A progressed Moon in this house propels you 
into an active, visible phase. You are pushing forward-a time 
for action. It is time for personal effort with visible results. You 
make your own decisions. 

There can also be an emphasis on your physical body, your 
physical appearance, your name, your signature, and so on. 


