From the personal action of the 1st, you then desire to con- 
solidate your resources. This may lead to a period of having to 
pay back debts due to rash or impatient actions. Alternatively, 
you may receive benefits from the personal actions of the 1st 
house, whose rewards can be financial, emotional or spiritual. 
However they express themselves, the driving force is the need 
to consolidate, to secure, to repair, or to build your base of 
security. 


