to support the idea that the development of human thought in 
a particular field is linked to an individual Saros Series. 

For example, the year that Gutenberg invented the printing 
press (1452), the year that Copernicus published his theory that 
the Sun was the center of the Solar System (1543), the year that 
Newton published his Laws of Physics (1687), the year that 
