for every time the transiting Moon conjoins the zodiac position 
of your natal Sun. Very similar to the standard lunar return, 
but this time you are returning it to the natal Sun's position 
rather than the natal Moon's position. 

The Kinetic Lunar return is a chart erected for the time that 
the transiting Moon conjoins the position of the progressed 
