Rules for the Retrograde Return. --- --- ---- 


Probably the major difference to be kept in mind is that, unlike 
the luminaries, the planets move both directly and retrograde 
through the zodiac. Therefore, you can have three Venus re- 
turns occurring in a short period of time. Which return to take 


